我猜是因为
说到底它们实在太便宜了。
I guess because
they were relatively cheap
when you think about it.

638
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:33,960
-尤其是在美国本土。
-以前是这样，
现在也还是这德行。
-In America, particularly.
-Well, they were.
They still are.

639
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:35,680
我是说，现在的美国车，
你懂的，
便宜得就跟三块五英镑白送一样。
I mean, American cars now,
you know,
they're only £3.50.

640
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:38,640
可等你头一回把引擎发动起来，
你就全明白为什么了。
And then you start
the engine for the first time,
you find out why.

641
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:41,360
-[全场大笑]
-直接碎成渣了！
-[ALL LAUGHING]
-It just all disintegrated!

642
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:42,920
话说，我能提这茬吗？
Now, can I bring this up?

643
00:33:42,960 --> 00:33:45,040
你看，
你是个虔诚的基督徒，
这大家都知道。
You see,
you're a Christian man,
we know this.

644
00:33:45,080 --> 00:33:47,080
而詹姆斯·梅呢，
Now, James May

645
00:33:47,120 --> 00:33:50,960
他有一套理论，说要是你在伦敦
按基督徒那种慈悲为怀的方式开车，
has this theory that if you
drive in a Christian fashion
through London,

646
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:53,080
你的通行速度跟我这种人
其实是一样快的，
you go just as fast
as people like me,

647
00:33:53,120 --> 00:33:55,880
-就是开车跟
头发着了火一样狂飙的人。
-[笑声]
-who drive like
our hair's on fire.
-[LAUGHS]

648
00:33:55,920 --> 00:33:58,840
你赞同这种说法吗？
就是如果主动让支路的车拐出来……
Would you subscribe to that?
If you let people
out of side turnings...

649
00:33:58,880 --> 00:34:01,840
我赞同。我觉得
有时候路人看到你主动让人，
I would. I think that
sometimes when people
see that you let people out,

650
00:34:01,880 --> 00:34:03,640
别人也会愿意给你让路。
you get let through yourself.

651
00:34:03,680 --> 00:34:05,920
然后奇迹般地，
你开上了M25高速，
And then miraculously
you get to the M25

652
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:08,800
哎呀我的天，
居然一路畅通！谢天谢地！
and, oh, my goodness,
it's clear. Thank you!

653
00:34:08,840 --> 00:34:11,160
-你看，我可不吃这套。
-[笑声]
-You see, I don't do that.
-[LAUGHS]

654
00:34:11,200 --> 00:34:14,880
我就冲着前车破口大骂，
死命闪大灯，直到他们靠边认怂。
I just shout at the person
in front, flash my lights
until they pull over.

655
00:34:14,920 --> 00:34:16,640
“滚开，老太婆！”
——没说您呐。
"Get out of the way, old bag!"
Not you.

656
00:34:16,680 --> 00:34:18,880
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

657
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:21,600
赶紧给我让开，
求求您了！
Get out of the way,
for crying out loud!

658
00:34:21,640 --> 00:34:23,480
总体来说吧，[轻笑]
On the whole, [CHUCKLES]

659
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:25,840
按现在的路况来看，
我觉得如果能……
with the traffic
the way it is, it seems to me
that if you can...

660
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:27,720
-能抢出两分钟
就算你走运了。
-是啊。
-If you gain two minutes
you're lucky.
-Yeah.

661
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:29,560
不管你怎么开，真就那样。
No matter
how you drive really.

662
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:32,640
我住的那个高档住宅区，
出门那条道特别难走。
I've got a very difficult road
to come out of,
my estate that I live in.

663
00:34:32,680 --> 00:34:34,600
一出来
就是条挺大的主路。
I come out
to a fairly main road.

664
00:34:34,640 --> 00:34:37,960
平时大家都不让，但在圣诞节前一周，
大家会慢下来，示意你……
And usually,
like a week before Christmas,
people slow down to go...

665
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:42,400
他们就会这样招招手。
所以每次我都……
They go like that.
And so, I've often gone...

666
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:44,400
简直难以置信，
他们居然真的愿意放你出来。
It's so difficult to believe
that they actually
let you out.

667
00:34:44,440 --> 00:34:46,680
-但到了圣诞节，人心确实会变友善。
-真的假的？
-But at Christmastime people
do become rather nice.
-Really?

668
00:34:46,720 --> 00:34:48,920
-千真万确。
-唔……不过话又说回来，
-Oh, yeah.
-Hmm... Then again,

669
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:51,520
-老子有五百匹马力，
统统滚开！
-[笑声]
-500 horsepower,
get out of the way!
-[LAUGHING]

670
00:34:51,560 --> 00:34:54,360
说到你住的那个豪宅区……
Speaking of this estate,
that you live in...

671
00:34:54,400 --> 00:34:55,920
-是圣乔治山庄，
对吧？
-对。
-It's St George's Hill,
isn't it?
-Yeah.

672
00:34:55,960 --> 00:34:57,920
在韦布里奇。
Which is in Weybridge.

673
00:34:57,960 --> 00:35:02,200
我猜你们家门上肯定有
那种带姓名缩写的电动大门。
Now, I'm guessing
that you've got kind of
monogrammed electric gates.

674
00:35:02,240 --> 00:35:04,400
-我猜得准吧？
-[结结巴巴]
-Am I right?
-[STUTTERING]

675
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:08,000
-因为我家的门天天坏。
-谁让你买便宜货的！
-'Cause mine just break
all the time.
-Don't buy cheap gates!

676
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:09,800
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

677
00:35:11,360 --> 00:35:14,440
-这理由挺有道理，
因为……
-[观众鼓掌]
-That is a good theory
'cause...
-[AUDIENCE APPLAUDING]

678
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:16,920
这理由确实站得住脚。
That's a good theory.

679
00:35:16,960 --> 00:35:19,160
我那大门是法国造的，
结果只开得了一扇。
Mine were made in France
and only one opens.

680
00:35:19,200 --> 00:35:21,920
所以我回家只能开
特别窄的那种车，
So I can only go home
in like, really narrow cars,

681
00:35:21,960 --> 00:35:23,800
好从唯一开着的那扇门
偷偷溜过去
to sneak through
the one gate that opens.

682
00:35:23,840 --> 00:35:25,160
其实我家的大门
一直挺好使的
Mine's been really
good actually.

683
00:35:25,200 --> 00:35:27,080
当然了，你肯定得
定期找人做保养
Obviously, you have to
have them serviced regularly,

684
00:35:27,120 --> 00:35:29,560
至于上面正好印着字母“C”
纯属巧合
but they just happen to have
"C" on them by chance

685
00:35:29,600 --> 00:35:31,400
纯粹是因为房子的名字
碰巧也是C开头的
because the house name
begins with C.

686
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:35,560
哦，对，没错！
我信了！
我百分之百信你这套鬼话！
Oh, right, yeah!
I believe that!
I absolutely believe that!

687
00:35:35,600 --> 00:35:38,480
行吧。来说说你的圈速
上场感觉如何？
Oh, right. So, your lap.
How was it out there?

688
00:35:38,520 --> 00:35:41,520
说实话，你猜最恐怖的
是什么时候？
Well, do you know,
the most terrifying
part of it,

689
00:35:41,560 --> 00:35:44,440
斯提格，原谅我直说
是他带我兜圈试驾的时候
forgive me, The Stig,
was when he drove me around.

690
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:47,760
我眼睁睁看着一堆轮胎墙
以接近80英里的时速直奔我脸砸过来
I'm looking at this
bunch of tyres
coming at me at 78 mph.

691
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:49,560
我心里当时就……[倒吸一口冷气]
I'm thinking... [GASPS LOUDLY]

692
00:35:49,600 --> 00:35:51,400
-就这副表情
-[众人大笑]
-Like this.
-[ALL LAUGHING]

693
00:35:51,440 --> 00:35:53,400
当然他心里有数
他知道什么时候刹车、过弯……
And of course he knows,
he's gonna brake,
make the turn...

694
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:56,080
我觉得这道题太难了
我们所有人都得先练上整整一个星期
I think it's really hard.
We all must need
a week to practise it,

695
00:35:56,120 --> 00:35:58,480
-然后再去跑圈计时
-没错！确实得这样
-and then drive the lap.
-Yes! That's true.

696
00:35:58,520 --> 00:36:01,400
不过嘛，我们手里正好有一段
你练习时的独家画面
Because we do have
some footage
of one of your practices.

697
00:36:01,440 --> 00:36:04,000
-[大笑]
-有谁想看的吗？
-[LAUGHS]
-Who'd like to see that?

698
00:36:04,040 --> 00:36:06,640
-现场观众：想！
-导播，切大屏幕！
-AUDIENCE: Yes!
-Let's put it on the TV.

699
00:36:06,680 --> 00:36:09,400
我就知道你们要放哪一段
I know the bit
you're gonna show.

700
00:36:09,440 --> 00:36:12,800
-克拉克森：又是倒数第二个弯道
-[轮胎尖叫声]
-CLARKSON:
Second to last corner again.
-[TYRES SQUEALING]

701
00:36:12,840 --> 00:36:15,000
-喔！漂亮！我就喜欢这个！
-[韦伯大笑]
-Ooh! Like it!
-[WEBB LAUGHING]

702
00:36:15,040 --> 00:36:16,320
[轮胎摩擦尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

703
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:18,680
[现场观众鼓掌欢呼]
[AUDIENCE APPLAUDING]

704
00:36:21,080 --> 00:36:22,480
-相当精彩
-是啊
-Very good.
-Yeah.

705
00:36:23,600 --> 00:36:25,440
哎呀，天呐！
Ah, goodness me!

706
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:28,760
转完这圈陀螺之后，我们……
After this spin, we had, uh...

707
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,640
好吧，总算跑了正式计时圈，对吧？
Well, we had the lap,
didn't we?

708
00:36:30,680 --> 00:36:33,360
对，我试了两三次，然后……
Yeah, well, I tried
a couple of times and I...

709
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:36,960
感觉……对我来说确实渐入佳境
但不得不说，我……
It got...
For me, it got better,
but I have to say, I...

710
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:39,040
这完全刷新了我对速度的认知
It's a new insight
as to what I look at

711
00:36:39,080 --> 00:36:41,320
平日里看赛车
都是以150英里的时速狂飙
when you see cars
that are racing
about 150 miles an hour.

712
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:43,840
-说实话，这车可跑不到那份上
-开这车显然没那待遇
-You're not in that, frankly.
-Not in this apparently.

713
00:36:43,880 --> 00:36:45,880
这辆利亚纳（Liana）……
The Liana...

714
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:48,400
-你在大后直道上拼了老命也才刚破80英里
-我知道。确实很惨
-You're struggling to top 80
coming up that back straight.
-I know. Yes.

715
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:51,040
-好吧
-我在最后那段直道上跑到了90！
-Okay.
-I did 90
on that last straight.

716
00:36:51,080 --> 00:36:52,280
-竟然有90！
-九……
-90!
-9...

717
00:36:52,320 --> 00:36:53,600
我跟你们讲。听我说
I'll tell you what.
I'll tell you what.

718
00:36:53,640 --> 00:36:55,320
我现在就想看这一圈。谁想看？
I wanna see this lap.
Who'd like to see it?

719
00:36:55,360 --> 00:36:58,000
-现场观众：想！
-我觉得这……
放录像！
-AUDIENCE: Yes!
-I think it's...
Let's put it on.

720
00:36:58,040 --> 00:36:59,120
[轮胎摩擦尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

721
00:36:59,160 --> 00:37:01,280
-起步不错，克里夫。
-我太喜欢这段了。
-Good start, Cliff.
-I love that.

722
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:04,000
克拉克森：起步很顺。
你觉得自己
算是个热爱驾驶的人吗？
CLARKSON: Good start.
Would you describe
yourself as a keen driver?

723
00:37:04,040 --> 00:37:07,880
克里夫爵士：我喜欢开车。
但我可不想
一辈子都这么玩命开。
SIR CLIFF: I like driving.
I'm not sure I would
like to do this forever.

724
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:09,920
讲真，我觉得这太难了。我是说……
You know, I find this is
really difficult. I mean...

725
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:13,000
-开车我倒是挺喜欢。
-开得蛮不赖嘛。
-Driving I like.
-That's not half bad.

726
00:37:13,040 --> 00:37:14,960
-克拉克森：这个弯走线很漂亮。
-是吗？
-CLARKSON: That's a good line
through that corner.
-Is it?

727
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:16,200
克拉克森：没错。
CLARKSON: Yep.

728
00:37:16,240 --> 00:37:19,480
-这个弯……漂亮。
-［轮胎尖叫声］
-This one... Yes.
-[TYRES SQUEALING]

729
00:37:19,520 --> 00:37:22,880
你看，前几天克里斯汀·史莱特过这儿，
差点把摄像师
给一头撞飞。
Now, you see, Christian Slater
the other day, he nearly hit
the cameraman doing that.

730
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:24,080
开得太毛躁了。
而你……
Far too aggressive.
Now you...

731
00:37:24,120 --> 00:37:25,480
克里夫爵士：［大笑］
这……快看……
SIR CLIFF: [LAUGHING]
This is... look at...

732
00:37:25,520 --> 00:37:27,360
克拉克森：瞧这眼神，
透着一股狠劲啊！
CLARKSON: That's a look
of determination there!

733
00:37:27,400 --> 00:37:30,040
噢，走得好！
Oh, yes!

734
00:37:30,080 --> 00:37:33,560
进弯太冲了，
这下白白丢了一秒。
Too fast through there,
that's cost you a second.

735
00:37:33,600 --> 00:37:35,400
克里夫爵士：
瞧，就是这个弯……
SIR CLIFF:
Now, this is the one...

736
00:37:35,440 --> 00:37:37,120
就是在这个弯
可以把车速
彻底提起来。
This is the one
where you could
pick up the speed.

737
00:37:37,160 --> 00:37:38,760
-我超爱这个弯。
-克拉克森：
对，确实走得相当漂亮。
-I love that bend.
-CLARKSON:
Yeah, that's really good.

738
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:40,320
克里夫爵士：斯提格当时
跟我说：
SIR CLIFF: Once The Stig
had said to me,

739
00:37:40,360 --> 00:37:42,840
“别慌，油门到底，
往前死冲就行。”
"Don't worry, just keep going.
Keep your foot flat down."

740
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:45,760
-看！就是这儿……
我最享受的就是这段。
-克拉克森：哇哦！
-There! That's the bit...
That's the bit I loved.
-CLARKSON: Whoa!

741
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:47,200
克拉克森：
所以你进弯前开到了90英里，
还是……
CLARKSON:
So you do it to 90 before that
or is it...

742
00:37:47,240 --> 00:37:49,240
克里夫爵士：其中一个弯吧。
我也不清楚他们是不是……
SIR CLIFF: One of them.
I don't know whether they...

743
00:37:49,280 --> 00:37:51,640
我记得是最后一个弯
我飚到了90。
I think it was the last one
I did 90.

744
00:37:51,680 --> 00:37:53,720
克拉克森：冲线了！
大功告成。
CLARKSON: And across the line!
There we are.

745
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:56,440
看着跑得
相当不错嘛这一圈。
That looks like
a pretty good lap.

746
00:37:57,360 --> 00:38:00,120
那么……
So...

747
00:38:00,160 --> 00:38:02,240
-说实话，可真够呛的。
-你觉得呢？
-That was tough stuff,
I have to say.
-Where do you think?

748
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:04,680
-你觉得我能
排在哪儿？
-你自己觉得呢？
-Where do you think
I might fit?
-Where do you think?

749
00:38:04,720 --> 00:38:07,480
咱们榜底可是沉底了一堆
不可救药的菜鸟。
We've got some pretty
useless people down here.

750
00:38:07,520 --> 00:38:10,600
而在最顶上，
坐着吉米·卡尔
和西蒙·考威尔。
And there we got Jimmy Carr
and Simon Cowell
sitting up there at the top.

751
00:38:10,640 --> 00:38:12,720
我觉得我大概
该排在沃根下面。
I think probably I should be
below Wogan.

752
00:38:12,760 --> 00:38:14,120
省得他整天
挂在嘴边显摆。
That will stop him
talking about it.

753
00:38:14,160 --> 00:38:15,920
其实他也算不上垫底。我看到……
Actually he's not
the bottom one. I see the...

754
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:18,200
-对，理查德·怀特利才是垫底的！
-理查德！
-No, Richard Whiteley is!
-Richard!

755
00:38:18,240 --> 00:38:21,120
理查德·怀特利，他那是被自己那件骚外套给晃瞎了眼！
Richard Whiteley, where he was
blinded by his jacket!

756
00:38:23,600 --> 00:38:27,520
天呐。不过我觉得自己
应该没比他快多少吧，是吗？要是快的话……
Oh, my God. Well, I don't
think I was much faster
than that, was I? If I was...

757
00:38:27,560 --> 00:38:29,760
你的成绩是一分……
You did it in one minute...

758
00:38:30,560 --> 00:38:32,800
-……50秒整。
-不会吧！
-...and 50 seconds.
-No!

759
00:38:32,840 --> 00:38:35,360
-你的名次相当高！
-［尖叫］
-You are well up here.
-[SCREAMS]

760
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:38,440
［观众欢呼鼓掌］
[AUDIENCE CHEERING]

761
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:41,640
-进专属俱乐部了！
-太棒了！
-An exclusive club!
-Fantastic!

762
00:38:41,680 --> 00:38:45,240
跟莱昂纳尔·里奇一个成绩，
跟帕特里克·斯图尔特一个成绩，
The same as Lionel Richie,
the same as Patrick Stewart,

763
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:47,880
跟杰米·奥利弗一样，
跟戈登·拉姆齐一样……
same as Jamie Oliver,
same as Gordon Ramsay...

764
00:38:47,920 --> 00:38:49,360
而且说来惭愧，
跟我也是一个成绩！
The same,
