better acceleration.

1030
00:52:42,600 --> 00:52:44,040
哈蒙德：没错，
加速更快。
HAMMOND: Exactly,
better acceleration.

1031
00:52:45,080 --> 00:52:47,880
[轮胎刺耳尖叫]
