All of those
low-profile tyres...

1040
00:53:09,040 --> 00:53:10,080
是的。
Yes.

1041
00:53:10,120 --> 00:53:11,360
比他的慢。
Slower than his.

1042
00:53:11,400 --> 00:53:13,000
是，但要是我
没改过保持原厂状态，
Yes, but if
I'd left it standard,

1043
00:53:13,040 --> 00:53:15,320
肯定比那台944
慢得更多！
it would've been a lot
slower than a 944!

1044
00:53:16,800 --> 00:53:22,840
不过詹姆斯得意没多久，
