"the longest number 11
skid mark on the track."

1054
00:53:42,580 --> 00:53:45,300
-这趟尝试肯定“油水十足”。
-没错。
-This should be a well-oiled
attempt, this.
-Yeah.

1055
00:53:45,340 --> 00:53:47,380
反正引擎盖底下
