There's no shortage of oil
under the bonnet.

1056
00:53:47,420 --> 00:53:48,860
-[笑声]
-行了，瞧瞧
他能整出什么动静。
-[LAUGHING]
-Right, let's see
what he does then.

1057
00:53:48,900 --> 00:53:50,020
来吧，詹姆斯！
Okay, James!

1058
00:53:50,060 --> 00:53:51,700
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SQUEALING]

1059
00:53:53,900 --> 00:53:55,300
-还不赖。
-说真的，确实可以。
-Not bad.
-Actually, it isn't.

1060
00:53:55,340 --> 00:53:56,900
确实不赖，真没想到。
他这次表现相当不错。
It isn't bad, I know.
He did quite well there.

1061
