Yeah. That was me
the other day in a Bentley.

1069
00:54:14,060 --> 00:54:15,180
走你！
Go!

1070
00:54:15,220 --> 00:54:16,820
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SQUEALING]

1071
00:54:18,420 --> 00:54:19,900
克拉克森：绝了。
CLARKSON: Amazing.

1072
00:54:19,940 --> 00:54:21,660
梅：行了。
把那头给我。
MAY: All right.
Give me the end.

1073
00:54:23,140 --> 00:54:26,580
35英尺整，
他把你给超了。
It is 35 feet,
he's beaten you.

1074
00:54:26,620 --> 00:54:28,260
它还是能干点事的！
It can do something!

1075
00:54:28,300 --> 00:54:32,020
不过，轮到我的
