and an automatic gearbox,
can't do smoking starts.

1079
00:54:43,380 --> 00:54:45,180
所以我得动点歪脑筋了。
So I'll have to be ingenious.

1080
00:54:45,220 --> 00:54:49,140
这辆车剩下的寿命，
