好嘞，准备。
三、二、一……
走你！
Yeah, right.
Three, two, one...
Let her rip.

1082
00:54:53,620 --> 00:54:55,100
[两人大笑]
[BOTH LAUGH]

1083
00:54:55,860 --> 00:54:57,620
