1088
00:55:04,940 --> 00:55:07,740
我有个绝妙的主意。
都往后退。
I've had a great idea.
Stand back.

1089
00:55:07,780 --> 00:55:09,820
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SQUEALING]

1090
00:55:11,140 --> 00:55:12,700
[引擎轰鸣]
[ENGINE REVVING]

1091
