That's not an 11, is it?

1096
00:55:31,420 --> 00:55:37,300
……39、40、41、42码！
...39, 40, 41, 42 yards!

1097
00:55:37,340 --> 00:55:40,900
哈蒙德：裁判们
得对杰里米那所谓的“亚洲版11”做出裁决，
HAMMOND: The judges
would have to decide on
Jeremy's Asian number 11,

1098
00:55:40,940 --> 00:55:45,300
