我们还得琢磨
最后一项挑战。
but in the meantime,
we had our final challenge
to think about.

1099
00:55:45,340 --> 00:55:47,100
“希望你们享受了
拥有保时捷的时光。”
"We hope you enjoyed
owning your Porsches."

1100
00:55:47,140 --> 00:55:50,500
[轻笑]
“现在你们每人
都必须把车卖掉，
[CHUCKLING]
"Each of you must now
sell your cars,

1101
00:55:50,540 --> 00:55:52,860
“并且得分规则是：
"and points
will be awarded

