-谁会从我手里买它啊？
-没人买！
-Who's going to
buy it from me?
-Nobody!

1111
00:56:16,620 --> 00:56:20,940
好了。现在来看比分。
比分情况，来瞧瞧。
Right. Now, the scores.
The scores. Here we go.

1112
00:56:20,980 --> 00:56:23,100
经历了这一切，
比完了烧胎起步，
So after all of that,
after the elevenses

1113
00:56:23,140 --> 00:56:25,980
外加他那条“西藏鬼画符”
被取消成绩，一分未得。
and his Tibetan squiggle
was disqualified,
no points there.

1114
00:56:26,020 --> 00:56:27,940
-不出所料。
-目前的积分状况如下。
-Predictable.
-This is where we stand
with the scores.

1115
00:56:27,980 --> 00:56:31,700
詹姆斯和我只差两分，
分别是27分和29分。
James and I are separated
by just two points
on 27 and 29.

1116
