CLARKSON: Minus 73,
so what about you?

1127
00:57:05,740 --> 00:57:07,500
- 啊！
- [全场大笑]
-Aah!
-[ALL LAUGHING]

1128
00:57:09,140 --> 00:57:11,700
我其实……
我还没卖掉呢。
I haven't really...
I haven't sold it.

1129
00:57:11,740 --> 00:57:14,540
